//! NCBI's own, read from the probe's `-outfmt "6 qseqid sseqid qstart qend sstart send qframe sframe btop
//! evalue"` (`out/<id>.c6.out`), one Dense-seg segment per run of aligned, query-only or subject-only
//! columns. Generated by `T/t3/scripts_t3a/gen_unit_tests.py`.

